          <a class="offer-item" href="product.html?slug=office-2021-pro-plus"><div class="img"><img src="assets/img/box-office-2021.webp" alt="Office 2021"></div><div><span class="tag">PRODUCTIVITY</span><h3>Office 2021 Pro Plus</h3><p>Perpetual license for 1 PC.</p><b>$58.00</b></div></a>
          <a class="offer-item" href="product.html?slug=win-11-iot-2024-value"><div class="img"><img src="assets/img/box-iot-win11-value.webp" alt="Win 11 IoT"></div><div><span class="tag">EMBEDDED</span><h3>Win 11 IoT Value</h3><p>LTSC with 10-year servicing.</p><b>$85.00</b></div></a>
