          <details open><summary>What is the minimum volume order?</summary><p>Quotes start from 5 licenses; larger quantities unlock deeper volume pricing.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Do you provide compliance documentation?</summary><p>Yes. Invoices, licensing summaries and SAM audit support are included with enterprise orders.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can you deliver keys in batches?</summary><p>Yes. Staged delivery and rollout support are available for large deployments.</p></details>
        </div>
